      "value": "I think there is many ways the current system could be changed. Personally I like the status system, and if I want to be on green, but I don't want to have a certain someone join me, this is where I unfriend them. It's already too easy to be fake on the internet.\n\nGive people an inch and they'll take a mile. Be careful out there.\n\nI'm not sure what the UI would look like, but I would use a feature where I could specify certain people into a list, and if I'm orange, those people can see where I am anyways, and if it's friends+ they can join me without the invite sequence. But I want them to know that my public status is orange.",
